# =============================================================================
# heapstore - AgentRT 数据分区核心模块
# Git 忽略规则配置
# 版本: 1.1.0
# 策略：非必要不追踪。仅忽略本地构建产物与运行时数据，
#       源码与必要配置保持可追踪，避免误推远程仓库
# Part of Airymax open-source project (agentrt)
# =============================================================================

# ---------- 编译产物 ----------
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.a
*.lib
*.la
*.out

# ---------- CMake 构建目录 ----------
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CMakeCache.txt
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
compile_commands.json
_deps/

# ---------- 大型二进制文件（防止误提交） ----------
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z

# ---------- IDE 与编辑器配置 ----------
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docx
